<p>My main concern here is that you're getting embroiled in backstory, such as things like the concept of a &quot;species true form&quot;; however, at this point, I don't know whether you consider the aliens/alternate humans who create the mass in the first place as backstory or not. What is the explicit occurring narrative here, without any backstory mentioned?</p>

