<p>Seeking Greenlights: No</p>
<p>Page Type: SCP Article</p>
<p>Elevator Pitch: is that you or me. no that's my cousin? or is it?.</p>
<p>Central Narrative: appears to be a detective from the late 18hundreds it wears a trench coat. From its trench coat it will bring items that mean things to its victims it then (transforms) into the person who owned the item SCP-3045 then begins to traumatise it victim making them cry, sob sometimes even kill themselves. it seems to also have a deal with another or more scps.</p>
<p>Hook/Attention-Grabber: this scp will make you think again about hugging grandma, as is it your grandmother or something else. and dont cry or one of his &quot;friends&quot; may find you</p>
<p>Additional Notes: I'm really new so I'm looking to improve. this was one of my first scps i made.</p>

