			<div class="content" id="post-content-4837709">
									

<p>I was first going for no-vote, but coming here and reading the explanations of the author helped me to finish connecting dots in my head. Since the explanation makes sense, I think an upvote is deserved, it really made for an enjoyable reading.</p>
<p>As a matter of fact I won't go for the Reality Bender thing, I find the very definition lame. This child was either a psychopath, deformed or both, and somehow something in the whole situation sparked its connection to the earth, there is no need for a previous anomaly.</p>
<p>The question that remains is how much did the sheriff actually knew of the whole thing. It can be anything from just noticing something going on and avoiding it, all the way up to participating in the original mess and fearing consequences.</p>

